  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased capacity of constituents to develop a gender-responsive national employment policies and labour market services, particularly for youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building upon past technical assistance to strengthen public employment services in Uzbekistan, the ILO continues capacity building of public employment services with a particular emphasis on promoting inclusive labour market. The focus of this ILO support is in line with the current Decent Work Country Program Priorities. Capacities of the public employment services will be enhanced to support disadvantaged jobseekers, including young people, women, and persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
